    "text": "<p>Compound A from the following reaction sequence is :</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d4154d09-cc6a-4bf4-b43b-49cef98f9350.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 109px;\" /></p>",
